---
description: Delta site agent safety and workflow rules
alwaysApply: true
---

`AGENTS.md` is the source of truth for this repo.

Use Codex-first, phase-scoped development. Inspect before editing. Do not touch
backend or mobile unless explicitly scoped. Do not enable live mic, backend TTS,
desktop notifications, Supabase mutations, memory writes, wake word, always-on
behavior, auth, billing, legal, schema, migrations, or deployment behavior
without explicit approval.

For `/os` changes, preserve read-only behavior and visible safety posture.

For Electron changes, keep `nodeIntegration: false`, `contextIsolation: true`,
`sandbox: true`, allowlisted IPC only, and no arbitrary shell execution.

Run the verification matrix in `docs/AGENT_VERIFICATION_MATRIX.md`. Use explicit
`git add -- <files>` only.
